Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:10.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想……走到最后两强。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just wanted to... Making the final two.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:13.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达里乌斯，如果你真的不能再比赛了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius, if you really can't play anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.35,0:00:14.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你就得娶蒂芙尼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}then you have to marry Tiffany.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.78,0:00:16.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你害罗密欧中了枪。你要是再……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you got Romeo shot. If you even...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.62,0:00:18.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把我们的男嘉宾送进了医院。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You put our suitor in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.22,0:00:19.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真相会牵连到瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The truth incriminates Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.79,0:00:21.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是她报的警。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's the one who called the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.32,0:00:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是记者。那个叫玛丽的女人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a reporter. That woman Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:25.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去年从屋顶跳下去的那个，那是谋杀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who jumped off the roof last year, that was a murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.23,0:00:26.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁给你消息的？杰瑞米。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's your source? Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.63,0:00:28.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这篇报道会势不可挡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This piece will be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.33,0:00:29.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你给我们梳理一遍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to walk us through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.53,0:00:31.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们撒了谎，我们掩盖了真相。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We lied, we covered it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:33.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}警察早该发现，达里乌斯……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Police should've known when Darius...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.27,0:00:34.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我们杀了她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause we killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.53,0:00:36.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把药吃了，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take the medicine, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.34,0:00:38.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我找了个地方。我们会把问题解决\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I found a place. We'll work things out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.17,0:00:40.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟一个不是你母亲的心理医生一起，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with a therapist who isn't your mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.41,0:00:44.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我们要把这里烧个精光。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}then we are going to burn this place down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.51,0:00:47.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我今天早上看到科尔曼从雅艾尔的房间溜出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw Coleman sneaking out of Yael's room this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:50.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}火辣版的你正在抢你的小男友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hot version of you is stealing your little boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:52.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你需要能撑起一集的内容。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need something that you can build an episode on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.49,0:00:54.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的目标是谁？雅艾尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's your target? Yael.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.52,0:00:57.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走开！天啊！你为什么要……？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go away! Oh, my God! Why would you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:01:00.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩，怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.33,0:01:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想要孩子，可我生不了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want kids, and I can't have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.20,0:01:04.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想成为任何人的失望。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I won't be anybody's disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.23,0:01:06.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有工作要做。奎恩？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have work to do. Quinn?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.30,0:01:08.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真的要让我走吗？是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you really going to let me walk away? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.64,0:01:11.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}科尔曼知道玛丽的事。他就要曝光我们了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Coleman knows about Mary. He's about to expose us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.31,0:01:12.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很抱歉，奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am so sorry, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.67,0:01:14.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们真的必须阻止他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We really have to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.68,0:01:24.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，宝贝，怎么了？嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, babe, what's up? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.72,0:01:26.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……别碰键盘，拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um... Hands off the keyboard, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.62,0:01:28.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等等等等。怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.79,0:01:31.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的人接到命令，要没收每一件\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My guys have been instructed to confiscate every piece
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.69,0:01:34.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这间办公室里的电子设备\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of electronic equipment in this office
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.23,0:01:37.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还要搜出任何备份或云端版本\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and to ferret out any backups or cloud-based versions
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.43,0:01:38.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们可能已经上传的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you might have already uploaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.93,0:01:41.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，你为什么要这么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.27,0:01:43.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我不知道。也许因为我不想被送去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, I don't know. Maybe because I don't want to get carted off
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.70,0:01:45.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}某个漂亮的精神病院\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to some beautiful institution
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.47,0:01:47.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而你去搞垮《永恒》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}while you take down "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.41,0:01:49.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。我知道你觉得那对我最好，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know. I know that that's what you think is best for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.81,0:01:51.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我其实知道什么对我最好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I actually know what's best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.48,0:01:53.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是这样。这太疯狂了，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which is this. This is crazy, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.68,0:01:55.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看吧，你又错了，科尔曼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See, that's where you're wrong again, Coleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.55,0:01:57.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我没疯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, I'm not crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.38,0:01:59.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事实上，我聪明到会给你前女友打电话，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In fact, I'm smart enough to call your ex-girlfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.69,0:02:01.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她告诉我，她跟你分手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who told me that she didn't break up with you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.59,0:02:02.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是因为你搬去了好莱坞。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because you moved to Hollywood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:05.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，她跟你分手其实是因为\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, she actually broke up with you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.26,0:02:08.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她发现你收买了一些落魄的亚洲群众演员\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when she found that you paid off some downtrodden Asian extras
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:10.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去扮演柬埔寨性奴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to impersonate the Cambodian sex slaves
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.93,0:02:12.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在你那部获奖纪录片里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in your award-winning documentary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.90,0:02:14.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真劲爆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.74,0:02:17.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以结果就是，你跟我们一样满嘴狗屎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So it turns out that you're just as full of shit as we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.34,0:02:19.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在接下来会这样……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now what's going to happen is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:22.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你对我们的事闭嘴，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are going to keep your mouth shut about us,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.41,0:02:25.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就对你的事闭嘴，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we will keep our mouths shut about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.28,0:02:27.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后大家就幸福快乐地生活下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and everyone will live happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.52,0:02:32.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我赢了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.79,0:02:35.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又赢了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.99,0:02:41.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:54.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚在《永恒》中，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tonight on "Everlasting,"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:58.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达里乌斯将在直播中做出最终选择。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius will make his final choice live on the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.65,0:03:01.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，退后，格雷厄姆。这又不是什么该死的三人行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, now step back, Graham. This isn't a fricking three-way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.88,0:03:04.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}B机位对准蒂芙尼。我要拍到大量嘲讽的翻白眼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep B cam on Tiffany. I want plenty of snarky eye rolls
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.55,0:03:06.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有她脸上那种“我刚闻了个屁”的表情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and that "I just smelled a fart" thing she does with her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.82,0:03:09.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就那个。对。完美。太完美了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That. Yes. Perfect. That's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.99,0:03:11.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你回来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:13.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错。你那边有什么，杰伊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Indeed. What do you got, Jay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:17.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有鲜花，有礼服，还有闪瞎眼的钻戒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got flowers, we've got dresses, I've got blinding diamond rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.46,0:03:19.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}实际上，我没有马车\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, I don't have a horse-drawn carriage
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.83,0:03:23.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为显然，上一季克莱兹代尔马把车道磕坏了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because, apparently, the Clydesdales dinged the driveway last season,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.04,0:03:24.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过……场地组很生气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but... Locations was mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.37,0:03:25.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，随便。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.81,0:03:27.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其他一切都浪漫到爆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything else is a romance explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.51,0:03:29.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，那太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mmm, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.04,0:03:32.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但人们想看的就是狗血闹剧，真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But people want a shit-show, literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.75,0:03:35.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果上周的收视率能说明什么的话，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If last week's ratings were any indication,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.75,0:03:38.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些卿卿我我的废话都没用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}none of this love-dovey boondoggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.29,0:03:40.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说好的贩卖真爱呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whatever happened to selling true love?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.49,0:03:42.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，那过时了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, that's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.96,0:03:47.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想看贱人流血。谢谢。开始吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to see a bitch bleed. Thank you. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:51.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看我们今天有什么，好吗，瑞秋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's see what we have today, shall we, Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.56,0:03:54.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如你所见，我设想我们的生活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As you can see, I don't just envision our lives
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:03:55.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}并不只是我们两个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to just be the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:57.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}愿景板，哇哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Vision boards, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:03:59.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我三年级的时候就做过了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did that when I was in the third grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.57,0:04:01.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们可以成为周围所有人的一盏明灯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can be a beacon of light for all those around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.88,0:04:03.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“一盏明灯”？谁会这么说话？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"A beacon of light"? Who talks like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.74,0:04:05.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}点燃火焰吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just light the flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.61,0:04:08.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你，香塔尔。太美了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, Chantal. That was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.58,0:04:11.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，呃，最后但同样重要的，蒂芙尼，轮到你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, uh, last but not least, Tiffany, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.95,0:04:14.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达里乌斯，我是说，当然\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius, I mean, sure
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.82,0:04:17.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们可以去我家的牧场玩，骑骑马。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we could hang out at my family's ranch and ride horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.73,0:04:19.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你能在自家牧场玩。你可真有钱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you can hang out at your ranch. You're so rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.59,0:04:20.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我为我们设想的生活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But the life I envision for us
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.99,0:04:22.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要比那多一点冒险。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is filled with a bit more adventure than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.00,0:04:24.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
