Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.35,0:09:11.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在全国电视上羞辱我，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You humiliated me on national television,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.85,0:09:13.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你和奎恩还，怎么，拿这事当笑话？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you and Quinn just, what, laughed about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:16.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。对不起，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. And I'm sorry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.16,0:09:18.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这全是我的主意，我知道那是错的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was all my idea, and I know that it was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.99,0:09:20.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个，奎恩就想在那边跟你说句话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Quinn just wants to speak to you right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.03,0:09:22.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。是……好吧。谢谢。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Is... Okay. Thank you. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.26,0:09:24.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。嘿，奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. Hey, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.10,0:09:27.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。呃，好，是这样的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. Uh, okay, here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.07,0:09:29.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}严格来说，我不该告诉你这个，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Technically, I'm not supposed to be telling you this,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:32.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但……就是你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but... it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.71,0:09:36.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达瑞斯选的是你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius is picking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.81,0:09:40.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.05,0:09:42.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊！天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God! Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.25,0:09:44.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊！太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ahh! That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.38,0:09:45.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.85,0:09:47.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且，还有呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And yet, there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.72,0:09:50.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，达瑞斯不仅会向你求婚，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, not only is Darius going to propose to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.66,0:09:55.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他还想今晚在电视直播上娶你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but he wants to marry you tonight on live television.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.80,0:09:57.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。太难以置信了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. That's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:10:01.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}确实难以置信，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is unbelievable, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.03,0:10:03.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你得马上把你家人接过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you're going to need to get your family here right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.97,0:10:06.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，好，好。当然。我现在就给我爸打电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, yeah, yeah. Absolutely. I'll call my dad right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.41,0:10:08.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他会乐疯的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's going to be so stoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.14,0:10:10.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，那肯定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:12.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你。我怎么说都不够。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you. I cannot say that enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:14.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，其实你说得够多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you can, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.08,0:10:15.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有……还有一件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And there's... There's one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.82,0:10:18.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你甩了切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm going to need you to dump Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.69,0:10:22.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在……说什么？我没有……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you... talking about? I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.86,0:10:24.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，蒂芙妮？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Tiffany?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.39,0:10:27.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那事真的不能再继续了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That really can't be happening
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.76,0:10:30.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你现在要嫁给达瑞斯，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if you're going to marry Darius now, can it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.80,0:10:32.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。你说得完全对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nope. You're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.97,0:10:35.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就当已经搞定了。哦，我会的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Consider it done. Oh, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:39.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，我们能不能先诚实一秒钟？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, can we just be honest for one second?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.44,0:10:42.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大概就是很多那种内化的厌女症，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Probably just a lot of, like, internalized misogyny,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.17,0:10:44.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，就像我恨你，可我其实更恨我自己。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you know, like I hate you but I really hate myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.74,0:10:47.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，我是女权主义者，我干的就是这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I'm a feminist, and this is what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.78,0:10:49.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，别想用莎拉·劳伦斯那套来教育我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, do not try to Sarah Lawrence me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.92,0:10:52.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是白痴。你很危险。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not an idiot. You're dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.32,0:10:54.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且据科尔曼说，你其实是个疯子，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And from what Coleman tells me, you're actually crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.72,0:10:57.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就让你更危险了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which makes you even more dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:11:03.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，那呃，我至少能试着补偿你吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, so, um, can I at least try to make it up to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.83,0:11:06.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为如果你愿意，我可以帮你改写叙事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause I could help you change the narrative if you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:09.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩今晚需要有人上镜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn needs somebody to go on camera tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.27,0:11:11.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去当面对质蒂芙妮的某个秘密。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to confront Tiffany about some hidden secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.27,0:11:13.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以当那个说真话的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You could be the truth teller.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.77,0:11:16.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你想让我上电视\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you want me to go on television
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.31,0:11:20.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去羞辱另一个女孩，就为了把注意力从我身上移开？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and shame another girl just to get the focus off of myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.08,0:11:21.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是美国的问题所在，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is what's wrong with America,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.45,0:11:23.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女人不停地伤害其他女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}women constantly hurting other women.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.08,0:11:25.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白了，希拉里，没问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got it, Hillary, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.25,0:11:27.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想告诉你，那些镜头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was just trying to tell you that all of that cameras
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.49,0:11:29.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都会对准你，全美国的眼睛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}would be focused on you, every eye in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.89,0:11:31.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会是明星。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You would be the star.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.89,0:11:34.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不就是你当初来这里的真正原因吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Isn't that really why you came here in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:39.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是说，你能从这个节目里得到更多，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just saying there's a lot more you can get out of this show,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.30,0:11:41.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而不只是一个丈夫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}besides a husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.11,0:11:52.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩，我不明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.34,0:11:54.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟两个女孩都说她们会赢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You told both the girls that they're going to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.31,0:11:55.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我当然说了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.95,0:11:57.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还说达瑞斯想娶她们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that Darius wants to marry them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.92,0:11:59.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃。听我说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.89,0:12:02.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上一季，安娜得意洋洋地\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Last season, when Anna was triumphantly
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.49,0:12:06.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走上楼梯，穿着那条蓬蓬裙，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}walking up the staircase and wearing that poof of a dress,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.53,0:12:09.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我意识到我再也无法用别的方式看待大结局了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I realized I could never see a finale any other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.33,0:12:11.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有什么比一个新娘更好？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what is better than one bride?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.80,0:12:13.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两个新娘？懂了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two brides? See?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.57,0:12:16.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可达瑞斯知道吗？呃，听着，笨蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But does Darius even know? Uh, listen, numbnuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:18.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想不想在大人那桌有个座位？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want a seat at the grownup table or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.14,0:12:21.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太想了。那就认真听，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So badly. Then pay attention, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.11,0:12:23.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求婚者假装向这些傻妞中的一个求婚，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The suitor fake-proposing to one of these bimbos
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.44,0:12:26.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在14季前可能还有点意思，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}might've been interesting 14 seasons ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.08,0:12:28.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但现在我们对观众有责任。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but now we have an obligation to our viewers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.88,0:12:31.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得升级紧张感，提高赌注，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have to escalate the tension, up the stakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.55,0:12:33.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让故事更复杂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}complicate the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.42,0:12:35.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两个新娘。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two brides. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.42,0:12:38.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达瑞斯被逼到墙角，他必须选蒂芙妮，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius is backed into a corner, he has to pick Tiffany,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.42,0:12:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让香塔尔被羞辱，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}leaving Chantal humiliated,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.99,0:12:43.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且还穿着那条漂亮的王薇薇婚纱，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and all in that beautiful Vera Wang dress,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.30,0:12:45.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让这一切更加令人沮丧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}making it that much more depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.53,0:12:47.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，可是……可香塔尔是我的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, but... But Chantal's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.90,0:12:50.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃。相信我，你也不想要蒂芙妮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh. Trust me, you don't want Tiffany, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.34,0:12:52.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么不要？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.47,0:12:56.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为一旦蒂芙妮稳稳当上达瑞斯·贝克夫人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because once Tiffany is safely ensconced as Mrs. Darius Beck,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.84,0:13:02.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就把雅尔那场屎风暴放回来，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we bring back the storm of poop that is Yael,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.15,0:13:04.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她会揭露蒂芙妮\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and she reveals that Tiffany
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.55,0:13:07.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一直偷偷跟执行制片人上床。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}has secretly been sleeping with the executive producer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.32,0:13:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？奎恩！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? Quinn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.49,0:13:15.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就是满地鲜血，屠宰场级别的收视金矿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is blood on the floor, an abattoir ratings bonanza.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:17.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你太厉害了。是的，我是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're incredible. Yes. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.06,0:13:19.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}香塔尔确实有个快死的奶奶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chantal does have a dying grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.07,0:13:21.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我绝对能把她弄来。哦，看，这才叫说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I could absolutely get her here. Oh, see, now we're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.20,0:13:23.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好，快去，快去。现在我们俩都输了，你这个小笨蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good job, go, go, go. Now we both lose, you little idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.54,0:13:25.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的女孩谁都没赢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Neither of our girls win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.14,0:13:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实，Darius要娶的是Tiffany，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, Darius will be marrying Tiffany,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:28.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以这算是赢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so that is a win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.01,0:13:31.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别紧张，我会给你奖金的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, just relax. I'll give you the bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.54,0:13:33.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们俩分了就行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You two can split it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.31,0:13:35.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这样？我们每季结尾\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So that's it, huh? This is just what we do
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.25,0:13:38.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都要这样羞辱求婚者吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}at the end of every season now, just humiliate the suitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.05,0:13:40.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这种节目我倒想看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, that is a show that I would watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.22,0:13:43.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看不出这对Darius多不公平吗，Quinn？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can't you see how unfair this is to Darius, Quinn?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.19,0:13:45.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们让他受了这么多，他该有个结局。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After everything we put him through, he deserves an ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.66,0:13:48.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是结局……只是不圆满，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is an ending... just not a happy one,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.56,0:13:51.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这已经是最真实的了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but it's about as real as it gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.34,0:13:59.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.57,0:14:01.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，Chet？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God, Chet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.47,0:14:03.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Chet，你来干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.58,0:14:05.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一点都不性感。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not sexy at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.95,0:14:07.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你干嘛？哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:09.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是想过来告诉你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just wanted to drop by and tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:12.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明白的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that, you know, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:15.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你明白？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.16,0:14:18.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.69,0:14:21.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，那……那就简单多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, that... that makes things really easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.09,0:14:23.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Quinn跟你说了？没有，不用她说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did Quinn talk to you? No, she didn't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.36,0:14:25.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你得玩这个游戏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know you got to play the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.36,0:14:27.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这游戏就是我发明的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hell, I created the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:30.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，呃，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, well, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:32.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你这么理解。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}thanks for being so understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.27,0:14:36.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上遍脱口秀，登遍杂志封面，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do all the talk shows and get the covers of all the magazines,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.71,0:14:40.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接几个大代言，赚一大笔钱，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}couple of beaucoup endorsements, make a lot of money,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.08,0:14:41.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后解除婚约。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then you break off the engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.41,0:14:43.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每年都这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Happens every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.12,0:14:45.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.65,0:14:47.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Chet，你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Chet, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.45,0:14:49.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得告诉你一件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, I have to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.29,0:14:51.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.19,0:14:56.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Darius今晚不只是想订婚，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, Darius doesn't just want to get engaged tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:14:59.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他想结婚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}he wants to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.57,0:15:02.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而我会答应。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'm going to say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.27,0:15:05.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那更好。回头再宣告婚姻无效。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Even better. Yeah, you'll get an annulment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.07,0:15:07.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这事我们能拖上一辈子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This thing, we can draw it out forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.11,0:15:08.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这……这太妙了。不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, that's... that's brilliant. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.51,0:15:12.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，Chet，我今晚就要嫁给Darius\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Chet, I'm going to marry Darius tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.11,0:15:13.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是真的结婚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.61,0:15:17.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}信不信由你，我爱他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Believe it or not, I love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.22,0:15:19.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真……我真的很抱歉，可是，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I re... I really am sorry, but, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.39,0:15:21.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你仔细想想，这……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when you really think about it, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.09,0:15:23.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们本来也没真正开始过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not like we ever really started anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:26.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那很荒唐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.06,0:15:28.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但也真的很温暖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was really comforting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.23,0:15:29.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}温暖？是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Comforting? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.76,0:15:32.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们必须结束。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But we have to end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.23,0:15:35.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，我……我得去准备了，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, I... I... I have to finish getting ready, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.67,0:15:43.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Yael同意了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yael's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.54,0:15:46.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看吧？你真是无所不能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See? You really can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.38,0:15:49.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，太容易了。教科书级的自恋狂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God, it was so easy. It was textbook narcissist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.55,0:15:52.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真不懂他看上她什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I don't really understand what he sees in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.05,0:15:53.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh. What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.25,0:15:55.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他看到的是我，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He sees me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.16,0:16:00.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是更年轻、更性感、伤得没我深。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}only younger, hotter, less damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.03,0:16:04.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错。不是你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Exactly. Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.03,0:16:06.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这男的是个白痴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Guy's an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.04,0:16:10.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在白痴的是我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now I'm the idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.50,0:16:14.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我搞砸了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I blew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.31,0:16:16.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像我妈说的那样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just like my mom said I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.34,0:16:18.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么叫像你妈说的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you mean, like your mom said?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.11,0:16:19.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.75,0:16:22.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Coleman黑了你手机，还想把我送进监狱，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Coleman hacked your phone and tried to put me in jail,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.55,0:16:26.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么还能搞砸？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so how did you mess that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.52,0:16:34.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我把这些……这些事全告诉他了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just told him all this... this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.06,0:16:37.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是那些……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, like stuff that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.50,0:16:39.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我小时候发生的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That happened to me when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.23,0:16:40.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.50,0:16:42.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，这就是人生一课。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, life lesson right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.54,0:16:46.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.44,0:16:49.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去他的Coleman。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Screw Coleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.71,0:16:51.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也去你的妈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And screw your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.48,0:16:54.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为信不信由你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause believe it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.48,0:16:58.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你经历的那些烂事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}all that crap that happened to you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.15,0:17:00.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}造就了现在的你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}made you exactly who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.09,0:17:05.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而你很完美。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you're perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.42,0:17:35.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，哥们，这座位有人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, man, this seat taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.42,0:17:39.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，我请你喝一杯。不用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, man. Let me buy you a drink. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.63,0:17:42.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么样？呃，让他后退。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How's it going? Uh, back him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.20,0:17:43.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给你？不用，我很好，谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For you? No, I'm good, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.90,0:17:46.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想喝酒的话，街那头有个装逼酒吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want a drink, man, there's a douche bag bar down the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.77,0:17:48.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}挺好笑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.70,0:17:50.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，说真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.77,0:17:53.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把我工作搞没了。你还想怎样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You ran me out of a job. What more do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.24,0:17:55.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我帮了你。《永恒》就是个地狱，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did you a favor. "Everlasting" is a hell-hole,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.74,0:17:57.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel就是个破坏球，走到哪毁到哪，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel's a wrecking ball who leaves nothing but devastation
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.68,0:17:59.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}身后只留下一片废墟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in her wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.91,0:18:02.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她甩了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She dumped you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.78,0:18:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这……也太快了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was... That was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.15,0:18:07.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也不算。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.79,0:18:11.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有个计划。我要让那节目停播。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have a plan. I'm gonna shut that show down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.29,0:18:13.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想帮我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.33,0:18:20.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有什么打算？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you have in mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.94,0:18:32.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚直播，Darius就要做出最终选择。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're getting closer to Darius' final choice, tonight, live.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.21,0:18:35.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}显然，他要做一个重大的决定，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Obviously, he has a very big decision to make,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:38.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而我们也准备了一些大惊喜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and we have some big surprises in store.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.45,0:18:41.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你根本想不到是什么惊喜，Graham。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you have no idea what kind of surprises, Graham.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.72,0:18:43.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会很兴奋的，说不定还会硬起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're going to be excited. You might even get a hard-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.49,0:18:44.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但首先，我们来回看一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But first, let's take a look back
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.89,0:18:46.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蒂芙妮和香黛尔的旅程，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}at Tiffany and Chantal's journeys,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.76,0:18:51.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两段旅程都始于简简单单的一步。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}two journeys which each began with one simple step.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.50,0:18:53.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，这一定会超级精彩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, this is going to be so exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.57,0:18:55.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放短片吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cue the packages.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.54,0:18:56.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你什么时候才肯从箱子里出来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When are you going to get out the box
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.94,0:18:58.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用你那双腿走路？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and start using your damn legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.67,0:19:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，还得再看一遍这些玩意儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh. The fact that I have to watch this stuff again
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.27,0:19:01.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真让我恶心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}nauseates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.87,0:19:03.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们把香黛尔的奶奶请来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So we got Chantal's grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.78,0:19:06.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她在车上，正往这儿赶。太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's in a car, she's on her way. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.28,0:19:08.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她完全不知道等着她的是什么，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She has no idea what's coming, does she?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.68,0:19:11.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你对咱们对这些女孩做的事，就从来没愧疚过吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you ever feel bad about what we do to these girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.72,0:19:13.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊！达瑞斯，太对不起了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God! Darius, I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.65,0:19:15.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.49,0:19:17.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，我们不愧疚。行了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, we don't. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.53,0:19:21.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，嘿，眼睛看这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, hey, eyes up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.49,0:19:23.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她就是个蠢货。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's a moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.60,0:19:25.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-卡。  -太烂了。我……我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That's a cut.   -That sucked. I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:28.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，挺好的。不，是我没进入状态，等一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, it was good. No, I'm not in the moment here, just hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.47,0:19:30.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，很好。我们继续往下走。我要再来一条，我没找到感觉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, it was great. We're going to move on. I need another take, I'm not feeling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.64,0:19:33.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不再来一条。我看过那些画面，都是别的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're not doing another take. I saw images of, like, other shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:35.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达瑞斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.88,0:19:38.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，你怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.31,0:19:39.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}挺好，多亏了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good, no thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.58,0:19:44.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，今天是最后一天了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, uh, well, today is the last day,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.35,0:19:48.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我就想过来跟你说，嗯……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so I just wanted to come over and say that, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.72,0:19:52.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很抱歉，关于警察和罗密欧的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was sorry, you know, about the cops and Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.86,0:19:54.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我当初就不该听你的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Should've never listened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.56,0:19:56.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第一天我坐着那辆加长车过来的时候，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When I pulled up in that limo, day one,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.76,0:20:00.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我早该看出那副救世主白女人的疯眼神\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I should've seen that do-gooder, white girl, crazy-eyed look
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.67,0:20:02.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当时就该跑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and run right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.37,0:20:04.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我倒真想跟你一起跑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would've really loved to have run with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.74,0:20:06.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我还得同情你？不，不，不。我只是希望……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now I'm supposed to feel sorry for you? No, no, no, no. I just wish that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.67,0:20:10.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道我希望什么吗？我希望我还能打橄榄球。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what I wish? That I could still be playing football.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.34,0:20:13.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，希望我是真的在向一个女人求婚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, that I was actually proposing to a woman
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.48,0:20:16.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个我爱的女人，希望我能赢下这场比赛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that I love, that I could have played the game and won.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:20.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我明白了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.89,0:20:22.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我明白了，明白了。没一样是真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I get it, I get it. Nothing's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.76,0:20:24.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全是假象。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all a facade.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.76,0:20:26.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我就演下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So I'll play that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.33,0:20:31.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗密欧，嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Romeo, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.46,0:20:32.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.90,0:20:35.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你害我中枪，所以我们别再说话了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got me shot, so we don't talk again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.60,0:20:37.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}永远。就这么回事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ever. That's how this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:39.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准备好了吗，达？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You ready, D?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.48,0:20:51.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.45,0:20:53.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}漫长的一天，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Long day, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.85,0:20:55.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.82,0:20:57.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么进来的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How did you get in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.32,0:20:59.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}制片助理不知道我被开除了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}PA doesn't know I was fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.33,0:21:00.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.79,0:21:02.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋被赶出去了，他们还没收了素材。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So Rachel's out, and they confiscated the footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.96,0:21:05.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？！科尔曼，你怎么能让这种事发生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?! Coleman, how did you let that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.46,0:21:07.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，还没结束，这就是我们来的原因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold on, it's not over yet, and that's why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.60,0:21:09.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，科尔曼觉得，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, uh, Coleman thought that,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.74,0:21:11.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许我该接受点媒体训练，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}uh, maybe I could use some media training,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.74,0:21:13.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你和我把口径统一一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you and I get our stories straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:15.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等他们放你出去，我就带上你和杰瑞米，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When they let you out of here, I'm taking you and Jeremy,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.58,0:21:19.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有我在CNN的朋友，今晚我们就把这事捅出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and my buddy at CNN, we're going to blow the lid off this thing tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.11,0:21:20.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这事由你们俩说出来，我觉得会是大新闻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This story coming from you two, I think, is going to be big.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.75,0:21:23.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们俩？我不能公开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Us two? I can't go public.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.12,0:21:26.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是……那完全是另一回事。听着，我们只有几个小时。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a... that's a whole nother story. Look, we got a couple hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.42,0:21:27.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想现在就给你们俩做准备，确保我们把……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to prep both of you right now, make sure we have our...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.69,0:21:29.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。我们也许用不着CNN。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait a minute. We might not need CNN.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.56,0:21:32.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们让我今晚直播出镜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They've asked me to appear live tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.53,0:21:34.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，你……你怎么弄到这种机会的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, how... How'd you finagle this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.96,0:21:37.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没耍什么手段。是瑞秋自己求我的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't finagle anything. Rachel just asked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.60,0:21:40.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她几乎是求我。他们想坑那位准新娘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She practically begged me. They're trying to screw over the bride-to-be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.73,0:21:42.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太蠢了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.07,0:21:43.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，她才刚从精神病院出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, she just got out of a psych ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.77,0:21:45.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她有点疯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's a little crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.51,0:21:46.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋进过精神病院？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel was in a mental hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.74,0:21:49.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不知道……哦，对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't... Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.08,0:21:51.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，罗密欧中枪，她就崩溃了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, so, so, Romeo got shot, she lost her mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.68,0:21:54.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她打给她妈，她妈把她送进了医院\N{\rEN\blur0.8}she called her mom, her mom put her in the hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.51,0:21:56.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还给她吃那些药。她当时神志不清。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and on these drugs. She was out of her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.78,0:21:58.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等我终于把她弄出来，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So when I finally got her out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.12,0:21:59.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她觉得那是告诉我的好时机\N{\rEN\blur0.8}she thought that was a good time to tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.62,0:22:01.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说她小时候被强奸的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about some crazy childhood rape.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.52,0:22:03.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是被她妈的一个病人干的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At the hands of one of her mother's patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.76,0:22:06.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，有那样的妈，你还指望什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, with a mother like that, what do you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.73,0:22:10.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，这事上你算躲过一劫，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, you dodged a bullet on that one, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.63,0:22:13.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，对。嗯……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, yeah. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.67,0:22:16.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我之前不知道这事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I didn't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.01,0:22:24.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，我一直在对讲机上呼你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, I've been trying to get you on the walkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.91,0:22:27.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我关了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I turned it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.08,0:22:29.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.12,0:22:31.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是受够了。你在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just over it. What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.58,0:22:33.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我居然真的让自己相信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know I actually let myselfieve
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.49,0:22:34.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们这季在做点好事？嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we were doing something good here this season? Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.02,0:22:36.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}找了个黑人单身汉？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With a black suitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.92,0:22:39.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我们就这么直接把达瑞斯坑了，图什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now we're straight-up screwing Darius over and for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.59,0:22:41.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}半个奖金，还得跟麦迪逊分\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Half a bonus I have to split with Madison
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.66,0:22:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达瑞斯什么都得不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and Darius gets nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.00,0:22:44.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蒂芙妮也好，香黛尔也好，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not Tiffany, not Chantal,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.86,0:22:46.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他连橄榄球都不能打了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}he can't even play football anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.90,0:22:49.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又一个创造历史的白人救世主，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just another Caucasian savior making history,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.54,0:22:51.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而你就这么愿意把一切炸掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you're just willing to blow it up just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.81,0:22:58.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那如果有别的办法呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So what if there was another way?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.82,0:23:06.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太激动人心了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is so exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.05,0:23:08.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们都要上直播电视了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're all going to be on live TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.22,0:23:11.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。我的香塔尔要结婚了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. And my Chantal is getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.12,0:23:12.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇！你看那个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aw! Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.86,0:23:14.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是她奶奶做的，连管子都算上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Her grandma made it, tubes and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.99,0:23:17.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}前排那个老头是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who is that old guy in the front row?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.93,0:23:21.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是蒂芙尼的爸爸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is Tiffany's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.80,0:23:23.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是再多点白头发，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you had more grey hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.74,0:23:25.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就跟照镜子一样了，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it'd be like looking in the mirror, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.77,0:23:30.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}笑吧，尽情笑吧。尽情笑吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go ahead, laugh all you want. Laugh all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.64,0:23:32.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你打造蒂芙尼就是为了让她嫁给达瑞斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You produced Tiffany to marry Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.98,0:23:34.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说明你有点嫉妒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That means you're a little jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.88,0:23:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，不是什么事都围着你转，切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, not everything is about you, Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.15,0:23:39.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过……不过我不嫉妒，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And yet... And yet, not jealous, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.02,0:23:44.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拥有这一切即将爆火，我怎么会嫉妒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not when I have all of this, which is about to explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.82,0:23:47.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呸！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.69,0:23:50.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋？瑞秋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel? Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.70,0:23:52.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你……你来这儿干什么？你不该在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What... What are you doing here? You're not supposed to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.60,0:23:54.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。我知道。我很抱歉。所有事我都抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know. I know. I'm so sorry. I'm sorry about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.80,0:23:56.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你抱歉什么，打我吗？你知道你不该来这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're sorry for what, beating me up? You know you're not supposed to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.67,0:23:58.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我知道，我知道。这事很重要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I know, I know. This is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.24,0:24:00.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听我说完。你在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just hear me out. What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.17,0:24:01.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起。科尔曼告诉我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry. Coleman told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.01,0:24:03.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他和娅尔，他们……是啊，他们的事我全知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Him and Yael, they... Yeah, I know all about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.81,0:24:06.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不，你不知道。她……她是记者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, you don't. She's... She's a reporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.75,0:24:09.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她马上要上直播，告诉全世界\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And she's about to go on live TV and tell the whole world
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.12,0:24:15.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我们害死了玛丽。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that we killed Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.72,0:24:20.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她在海边卖贝壳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She sells seashells down by the seashore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.09,0:24:22.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一只大黑虫咬了一只大黑熊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A big black bug bit a big black bear
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.06,0:24:25.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咬在大黑屁股上，大黑屁股流出了黑血。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in the a big black butt, and the big black butt bled black blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.63,0:24:30.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，你知道，你看起来美极了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, so, you know, you do look absolutely amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.10,0:24:32.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢，麦迪逊。你也很可爱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, Madison. You look cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.74,0:24:34.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.07,0:24:36.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道该说什么，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you know what to say, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.58,0:24:37.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，当然，我完全知道我要说什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah, I know exactly what I'm going to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.94,0:24:39.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就等他们说完誓言\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you just wait till they say the vows
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.68,0:24:41.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和“我愿意”，那就是我们的信号。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and the I do's, and that's our cue.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.18,0:24:42.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。没问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yep. All good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.62,0:24:44.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.78,0:24:46.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得做点什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.15,0:24:48.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，她在那儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, there she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.69,0:24:50.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，杰瑞米，你得走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, Jeremy, you got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.22,0:24:52.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。不。让我留下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. No. Let me stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.33,0:24:56.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，五分钟后到摄像车找我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, just meet me in the camera truck in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.90,0:24:59.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.13,0:25:00.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，各位，开演了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, people, showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.93,0:25:05.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来倒数。准备好了吗？3，2，1。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here's my count. Ready? In 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.20,0:25:11.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎回到《永恒》，在这里爱总能找到出路。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome back to "Everlasting," where love always finds a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.08,0:25:13.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的寻爱之旅已到终点，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We've come to the end of our journey of love,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.24,0:25:15.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一段旅程……这些人根本不知道这里发生了什么，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a journey... These people have no idea what goes on here,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.82,0:25:17.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比如他们对你做的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}like what they did to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.62,0:25:19.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们拿了该拿的就走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's just get what we came for.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.99,0:25:22.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧？我没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You good? I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.82,0:25:24.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没得选，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't have a choice, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.82,0:25:26.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}确实没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.22,0:25:28.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麦迪逊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Madison.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.36,0:25:31.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，呃，奎恩让你去看看香塔尔的奶奶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, uh, Quinn wants you to check in on Chantal's grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.33,0:25:33.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天，她窒息了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God, is she suffocating?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.06,0:25:34.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天，她呼吸困难。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God, she's having a really hard time breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.00,0:25:36.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不，不，不，不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.90,0:25:39.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚在《永恒》是个非常特别的夜晚，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tonight is a very special evening here on "Everlasting,"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.27,0:25:41.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不仅对我们的选手，对我个人也是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}not only for our contestants, but also for me personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.31,0:25:43.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，这不是关于你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God, this is not about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.84,0:25:46.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就是个无足轻重的废物，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are an insignificant turd,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.78,0:25:49.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以来吧，我们继续节目。女士们先生们……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so come on, let's get on with the show. Ladies and gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.92,0:25:53.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在搞什么名堂，双胞胎？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you up to, twinsie?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.12,0:25:56.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。呃，我不知道我该坐哪儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Uh, I don't know where I'm supposed to sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.16,0:25:57.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.79,0:25:59.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这个叛徒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.32,0:26:00.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.93,0:26:03.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是个满身汗臭的小报记者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a sweaty, tabloid hack.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.36,0:26:05.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰瑞米出卖了我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jeremy sold me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.90,0:26:09.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不，他没出卖你。他太清楚你值几斤几两了……他把你交出去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no, he didn't sell. He knows exactly what you're worth... He gave you away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.10,0:26:11.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，能叫保安过来吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, can we get security here, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.20,0:26:13.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行。你可以阻止我上节目，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine. You can stop me from being on the show,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.87,0:26:16.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你阻止不了我告诉全世界你们这些人干的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but you can't stop me from telling the world what you people do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.04,0:26:17.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，对，能把她带进一个房间吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, yeah, can we get her in a room, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.01,0:26:19.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把门锁上，确保没人进来。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's lock the door and make sure no one comes in. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.78,0:26:21.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你堵不住我的嘴，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't shut me up, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.75,0:26:23.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的决定再艰难不过了，女士们先生们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His decision cannot be any harder, ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.82,0:26:25.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，我们有名门千金香塔尔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course, we have debutante Chantal
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.92,0:26:28.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者职业橄榄球界的公主蒂芙尼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or pro-football royalty Tiffany.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.35,0:26:29.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达瑞斯会选谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who will Darius choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.99,0:26:32.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们这就揭晓，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I say we find out, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.09,0:26:34.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为他来了……达瑞斯·贝克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because here he is... Darius Beck.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.06,0:26:39.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊，开始了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.43,0:26:41.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底去哪儿了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where the hell have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.17,0:26:42.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是几个最后一刻的小问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just a couple last-minute issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.00,0:26:45.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切都好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.10,0:26:47.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，最好是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, well, it better be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.04,0:26:48.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋在哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.24,0:26:50.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.18,0:26:53.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但谁先到，我们就得独家播谁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But we have to go exclusive with whoever can get here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.11,0:26:55.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.68,0:26:58.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。喜欢。回头见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great. Love it. I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.02,0:27:06.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚《永恒》有个惊喜，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In an "Everlasting" surprise, this evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.26,0:27:09.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不会有求婚……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we will not be having a proposal...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.06,0:27:13.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而是应达瑞斯的特别要求，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but instead, with Darius' special request,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.46,0:27:15.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们将举行一场婚礼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we're going to be having a wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.13,0:27:16.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.87,0:27:19.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}惊喜吧！看他的表情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Surprise! Look at his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.91,0:27:21.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记住，你在直播。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Remember, you're on live television.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.01,0:27:23.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，来吧，开始了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, come on, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.38,0:27:25.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}音乐起，干冰上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cue the music, cue the dry ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.08,0:27:26.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快，快，快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go, let's go, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.12,0:27:36.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！两个新娘！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! Two brides!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.49,0:27:37.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.10,0:27:47.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.40,0:27:49.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.17,0:27:50.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这干什么？Chantal！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing here? Chantal!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.44,0:27:52.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天是我的婚礼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is my wedding day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.77,0:27:53.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为这是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you think this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.94,0:27:55.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对！对！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.51,0:27:57.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}新娘对新娘撕逼！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bride-on-bride cat fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.14,0:27:59.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇！太精彩了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoo-hoo! This is fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.85,0:28:01.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是被特意通知的。你听错了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was specifically told. You heard something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.81,0:28:03.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？他们特意通知我的。哦，等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? They specifically told me. Oh, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.48,0:28:04.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，我们得切广告了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, uh, we have to cut to commercial.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.92,0:28:06.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上切广告。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go to commercial right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.22,0:28:07.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，切入广告。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, that's a cut for commercial.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.89,0:28:09.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Dan！搞什么！干得好。嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dan! What the heck! Great job. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.32,0:28:11.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.46,0:28:13.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也不知道。我以为你们只会来一个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't know, either. I thought there was only going to be one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.22,0:28:16.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用帘子这招真妙！天才！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great idea with the curtain! Genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.33,0:28:17.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，来，把它放下来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Come on. Let's get this down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.83,0:28:20.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，这太精彩了，各位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, this is fantastic, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.77,0:28:23.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，那是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oop. Wait, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.34,0:28:25.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁把我的人叫走了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who sidelined my girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.37,0:28:27.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.31,0:28:29.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Coleman？嗨。然后……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Coleman? Hi. And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.31,0:28:31.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。你就别费劲了，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. You should just give it a rest, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.18,0:28:33.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Yael被看住了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yael's on lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.14,0:28:35.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直到《娱乐周刊》的记者\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that is until our reporter from Entertainment Weekly
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.38,0:28:37.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来这为止。那是什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}gets here. What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.95,0:28:39.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，好像他们听说了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, it seems that they got wind
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.48,0:28:41.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是怎么撒谎混进节目的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of how she lied her way onto the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.42,0:28:44.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，对，他们要写篇文章揭穿她，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, yeah, and they're going to do an article discrediting her,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.16,0:28:45.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以从现在起，没人会信她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so from here on end, nobody's going to believe a word
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.02,0:28:48.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说的任何一个字。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that comes out of her mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.13,0:28:50.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是这么想的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that what you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.23,0:28:54.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不是想。我确定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I don't think. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.17,0:28:56.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，你们看起来不错。准备好了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, you guys look good. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.20,0:29:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，5、4、3、2、1直播。开始。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, we're live in 5, 4, 3, 2, 1. Action.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.27,0:29:01.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Darius。Darius。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius. Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.41,0:29:03.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，他真完美。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, he's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.11,0:29:05.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人家是运动员，四分卫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, the man's an athlete. He's a quarterback.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.44,0:29:08.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那跟他会笑有什么关系？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What does that have to do with him being able to smile?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.45,0:29:12.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Darius，你显然有个重大的决定要做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius, um, you obviously have a very big decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.28,0:29:15.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要怎么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.12,0:29:18.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，去吧，揭穿Yael。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Go ahead. Discredit Yael.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.42,0:29:21.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我就自己站出来。哦，是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll just come forward myself. Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.23,0:29:22.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我承认我伪造了纪录片。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll admit I faked the documentary.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.83,0:29:24.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你为什么要那么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.33,0:29:27.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是我认错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's mea culpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.43,0:29:29.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那还有谁比你更了解\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then who better to expose the seedy underbelly
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.90,0:29:32.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们这行的肮脏内幕？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of what you do here than someone who knows exactly how it's done?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.97,0:29:36.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，只不过你绝不会这么做，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, except that you would never do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.34,0:29:38.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为风险太大。看着我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because it's too big of a risk. Watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.54,0:29:41.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要把你的帝国烧成灰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll burn your empire to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.05,0:29:43.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你和你那些反社会同伙\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you and your fellow sociopaths
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.25,0:29:46.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会进监狱，你们该待的地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}will go to jail where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.49,0:29:50.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你原本的计划是什么？你打算怎么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What was your plan? What were you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.36,0:29:53.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为拍完你留不住Yael。然后呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause you can't keep Yael past wrap. What then?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.12,0:29:55.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我们会真的去找媒体\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause we're actually going to go to the press
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.16,0:29:56.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉他们你能做到什么地步\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and tell them just how far you'll go
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.40,0:29:59.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就为了做烂节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to make really bad television.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.23,0:30:01.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而你屁都做不了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And there's not one damn thing you can do about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.57,0:30:03.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我赢了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.44,0:30:08.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去享受你的小结局吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go to your little finale and enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.27,0:30:09.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那会是你的最后一次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll be your last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.19,0:30:24.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……Darius，他到底在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh... Darius, nWhat the hell is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.12,0:30:25.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……他像只羊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh... He looks like a sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.56,0:30:27.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这叫恐慌发作，Quinn。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's called a panic attack, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.09,0:30:28.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，拜托，行了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, please, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.90,0:30:32.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，就选Tiffany。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, just pick Tiffany.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.06,0:30:36.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我需要点时间，呃，跟我的伴郎商量下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think I need a moment to, uh, consult with my best man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.14,0:30:37.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.34,0:30:39.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么卡住了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's the hold-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.01,0:30:42.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们先生们……这太扯了。我走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies and gentlemen... This is some B.S. I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.61,0:30:44.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}D，别。别别别别。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}D, no. No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.44,0:30:45.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们要我结婚？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They want me to get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.64,0:30:47.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}兄弟，这可不是我报名参加的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Man, this is not what I signed up for.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.51,0:30:49.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，就差一点了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.42,0:30:51.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我需要你做个选择。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So what I'm going to need for you to do is make a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.42,0:30:53.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你现在就做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.12,0:30:55.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}家里数百万观众在看着、祈祷着……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Millions of you at home are watching, praying...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.35,0:30:57.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不行，这是电视，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no no way, this is TV, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.56,0:31:00.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}婚姻是真实的，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Marriage is for real, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.36,0:31:02.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不干。听着，你之后可以宣布无效。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not doing it. Look, you can annul later.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.56,0:31:04.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.23,0:31:05.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不想以公关灾难收场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We do not want this to end in a PR disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.00,0:31:07.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，这些女孩把家人都带来了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, these girls brought their families, okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.47,0:31:08.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以对她们来说也是真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so it's real for them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.97,0:31:11.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我做不到，如果我并非真心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't, not if I don't mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.34,0:31:13.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就真心。开始了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then mean it. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.70,0:31:17.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，Darius，你做好决定了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With that being said, Darius, have you made your decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.71,0:31:21.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要娶我们哪位美丽的女嘉宾？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which one of our beautiful ladies are you going to marry?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.55,0:31:25.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们一起经历了这么多，不是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We've been on quite a journey together, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.12,0:31:26.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rach。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.02,0:31:28.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行。但等等，你刚才……？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't. But, wait, did you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.55,0:31:29.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从我们开始的那天起……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ever since the day we started...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.99,0:31:31.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，我需要你一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, I need you for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.36,0:31:32.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.99,0:31:34.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我……杰，你来接手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I... Jay, take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.73,0:31:36.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么鬼？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.40,0:31:38.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我试过阻止他们，但雅尔和科尔曼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I tried to stop them, but Yael and Coleman
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.16,0:31:40.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚决赛一结束就要去找媒体。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}are going to the press tonight as soon as the finale's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.20,0:31:42.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们要把节目搞垮，昆恩。我们都得坐牢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're going to take down the show, Quinn. We're all going to jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.33,0:31:43.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我什么都做不了。瑞秋！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And there's nothing that I could do. Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.64,0:31:46.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们正在直播决赛，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are in the middle of a live finale,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.24,0:31:48.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我在制片，好吗，你去处理掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which I am producing, okay, so just go and handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.61,0:31:51.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么处理？我不管，好吗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How? I don't care, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.14,0:31:54.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们说好要搞垮他，那就搞垮他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We said we were going to take him down, so take him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.71,0:31:56.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的恶龙。去吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your dragon. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.52,0:31:58.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两位美丽的女士……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two beautiful women...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.62,0:32:00.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，嘿，麦迪逊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, hey, Madison?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.59,0:32:03.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你去把自己打扮得，呃，漂亮点，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to go and get yourself, uh, pretty, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.49,0:32:05.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准备好上镜，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get camera-ready,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.49,0:32:08.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你要去狠狠揭穿蒂芙妮，去吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because you are going to drop the hammer on Tiffany, so go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.09,0:32:09.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快去快去快去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go, go, go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.46,0:32:11.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 嫉妒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Jealousy
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.06,0:32:13.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦拜托，别这样了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, please, get over it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.56,0:32:17.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很明显，我知道自己该做什么，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's obvious, I know what I have to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.04,0:32:20.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我结婚，就是要一辈子，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because when I get married, it's going to be forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.37,0:32:22.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是真心的。哦……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it's going to be real. Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.64,0:32:24.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很在乎你们每一个人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I care so much for each one of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.48,0:32:27.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他又来了，你知道吗，每次跟格雷厄姆都这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's doing it again, you know, every time with Graham.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.11,0:32:29.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我觉得不……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, I don't think...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.25,0:32:31.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有什么事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.12,0:32:33.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}丹？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dan?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.15,0:32:35.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要走了。嘿，麦迪逊，坐下吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna get out of here. Hey, Madison, have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.09,0:32:37.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道我必须做个决定，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know I have decision that I have to make,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.22,0:32:40.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要在这里做出决定，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I'm going to make the decision right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.53,0:32:42.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是现在。终于。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}right now. Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.26,0:32:45.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以凭良心说，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So in good conscious,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.20,0:32:48.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能娶你们中的任何一个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just can't marry either one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.77,0:32:52.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露比？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.64,0:32:56.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她到底在这儿干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell is she doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.62,0:33:08.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是怎么回事？你在这儿干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is happening? What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.62,0:33:11.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.82,0:33:16.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道有多久没人问过我这句话了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you know how long it's been since someone asked me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.26,0:33:18.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰告诉我你有麻烦了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jay told me you were in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.56,0:33:20.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也许有什么话想对我说？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You might have something that you want to say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.70,0:33:23.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你根本想不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.37,0:33:26.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}首先我想对你说，在上帝面前，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First I want to say to you, in front of God,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.70,0:33:31.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在所有人面前，呃，我当初不该淘汰你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in front of everybody, um, I never should've cut you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.24,0:33:33.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是个天大的错误。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was a huge, huge mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.61,0:33:35.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说得好。看看这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good for him. Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.51,0:33:38.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《永恒》上居然发生了真实的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Something real is actually happening on "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.75,0:33:40.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，昆恩，你还想让我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Quinn, do you still want me to...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.82,0:33:44.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一直都说实话，露比。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've always told the truth, Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.12,0:33:46.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我一直喜欢你的地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what I've always loved about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.16,0:33:48.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以现在轮到我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.66,0:33:52.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。哦，绝对不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. Oh, hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.50,0:33:56.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露比·卡特，你愿意嫁给我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ruby Carter, will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.87,0:34:01.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.31,0:34:04.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}答应他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.78,0:34:07.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.38,0:34:09.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}婚礼？拜托。愿意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A wedding? Come on. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.72,0:34:11.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么不？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.62,0:34:13.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们才认识九周。好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We've known each other for nine weeks. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.25,0:34:14.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那太疯狂了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.65,0:34:17.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回到台上来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come back up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.32,0:34:20.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我对你的感觉，达里乌斯，是真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What I feel for you, Darius, that's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.83,0:34:23.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.86,0:34:26.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也知道的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.70,0:34:29.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以让我们离开这些镜头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So let's get away from all these cameras
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.87,0:34:32.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看会怎样，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and see what's there,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.60,0:34:37.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看我们真正能拥有什么，只有你和我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}see what we can have together for real, just you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.24,0:34:39.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.88,0:34:42.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.26,0:34:57.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才是真爱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, that is true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.36,0:35:01.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真爱……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}True love...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.37,0:35:03.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁能得到呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who gets that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.57,0:35:06.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们先生们，这就是爱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies and gentlemen, that's love.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.64,0:35:15.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了各位，我们……我们出去吧，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, guys, let's... Let's head outside, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.38,0:35:17.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}昆恩，你还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.73,0:35:34.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不可能，老兄。节目结束了，我们走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not a chance, man. Show's over, and we're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.73,0:35:36.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。我去看看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold on. Let me check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.54,0:35:40.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.87,0:35:43.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，出发。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, let's roll. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.25,0:35:55.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，嘿，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, hey, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.82,0:35:59.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，那个，呃，我觉得你真的该走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, so, um, I think you should just really leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.89,0:36:02.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的意思是，都结束了。雅尔和科尔曼，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, it's over. Yael and Coleman,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.43,0:36:05.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们今晚就要去找媒体了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}they're going to, like, go to the press tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.86,0:36:08.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且还有……我……我……我根本不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, and there's like... I... I... I just don't even know
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.60,0:36:10.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这时候我们还能说什么来抹黑他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}what we could say to discredit them at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.84,0:36:12.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们基本上就像一颗炸弹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're basically like this bomb
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.60,0:36:15.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道我们做过的每一件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that knows every single thing that we've ever done.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.31,0:36:17.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许这才是正确的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe it's, like, the right thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.28,0:36:18.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，也许这样最好？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you know, maybe it's for the best?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.01,0:36:20.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.68,0:36:22.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者也许我就该去坐牢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or maybe I should just, like, go to jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.01,0:36:24.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋。我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rach. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.72,0:36:26.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的意思是，我可能真的是疯了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I actually might, in fact, be crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.89,0:36:28.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}疯子会做可怕的事，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, crazy people do horrible things,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.82,0:36:30.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而我也做过可怕的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I've done horrible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.32,0:36:31.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你比谁都清楚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, you know that better than anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.82,0:36:33.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道。我并不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know. I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.59,0:36:35.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，我以前不知道你经历过什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rach, I didn't know what happened to you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.86,0:36:40.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，是不是从那时起你妈开始给你治疗，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, is that when your mom started treating you,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.47,0:36:41.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就因为那件事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'cause of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.93,0:36:44.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，我怎么那么蠢？我竟然信了她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God, how dumb? I just trusted her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.34,0:36:45.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。我当时太生气了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't know. I was just so angry,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.97,0:36:48.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且我……我太爱你了，愿意为你做任何事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I... I love you so much and I'd do anything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.97,0:36:50.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就想着……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I just thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.98,0:36:52.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我们结束了，杰瑞米，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I mean, we're just over, Jeremy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.81,0:36:54.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道的。结束了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know that. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.65,0:36:56.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这事我们不可能挽回了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No way that we're ever going to come back from that,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.75,0:36:58.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且整件事马上就要曝光了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and this whole thing is about to come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.88,0:37:00.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道，我知道，我知道。好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know, I know, I know. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.75,0:37:02.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这……我是说……求你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's... I mean... Just please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.55,0:37:04.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，我们可以试试……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, we could try...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.49,0:37:06.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行，不行！我们都要坐牢的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, we can't, dude! We are all going to jail!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.66,0:37:08.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还不明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you not get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.43,0:37:11.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吗？谁也阻止不了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay? There is nothing that anybody can do to stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.53,0:37:19.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，都怪我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God, this is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.65,0:37:33.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他怎么能这么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, how could he do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.42,0:37:35.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他答应过的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.09,0:37:36.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}本来应该是我们中的一个，你或者我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was supposed to be one of us, either you or me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.89,0:37:38.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，但不是她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, but not her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.76,0:37:41.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就好像他们知道他在骗我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And it's like they knew that he was tricking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.79,0:37:44.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}利用我们。就是在利用我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like using us. Like using us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.66,0:37:47.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来，美人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here, beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.60,0:37:50.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，大家准备好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, guys, get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.80,0:37:54.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好。你也是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good job. You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.97,0:37:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是你这季想要的，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is what you wanted for the season, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.48,0:37:59.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全是我干的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.92,0:38:12.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人一生中很少有这种时刻，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There are so few times in your life
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.66,0:38:16.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道自己做了正确的选择，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when you know you made the right choice,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.53,0:38:19.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}遇见了那个特别的人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when you've met that special person
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.53,0:38:22.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}改变了你的人生轨迹，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that changes the course of your life
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.83,0:38:26.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而后悔已成往事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and when regret is a thing of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.97,0:38:30.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，“新婚快乐”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, "Just Married."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.07,0:38:32.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先放那儿吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's leave it up there for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.08,0:38:34.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看感觉如何。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See how it feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.11,0:38:38.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恭喜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.85,0:38:41.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们会很穷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They gonna be poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.62,0:38:43.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们会很幸福。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're gonna be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.72,0:38:45.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}幸福更重要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Happy is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.03,0:38:51.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是那种时刻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is one of those times.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.57,0:38:56.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡。杀青了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cut. That's a wrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.87,0:39:01.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，大家趁天亮前撤吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, everyone, let's get out of here before daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.87,0:39:04.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，瑞秋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Rach?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.44,0:39:06.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.14,0:39:07.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.05,0:39:22.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 噢，我的爱，我想我快要溺亡 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Oh, my love, I think I'm drowning *
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.59,0:39:27.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 带我沉入海底，我想让你知道无论发生什么，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Take me down into the sea I want you to know whatever happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.73,0:39:30.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你都是我的家人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you're my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.94,0:39:33.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.04,0:39:35.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们永远拥有彼此。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll always have each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.61,0:39:38.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。我们永远有彼此。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. We'll always have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.48,0:39:43.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 你会来救我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Won't you come rescue me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.82,0:39:56.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 每个清晨我都在寻找 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Spend my mornings just searching *
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.23,0:40:00.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 独自徘徊在这些路上 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Wandering down these roads alone *
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.93,0:40:03.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈哈。看看你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ha-ha. Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.70,0:40:07.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}原来你才是真正的制作人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As it turns out, you were the showrunner, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.17,0:40:09.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，昆恩？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Quinn?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.21,0:40:11.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你做到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you nailed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.18,0:40:14.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}黑人追求者，黑人老婆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Black suitor, black wifey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.71,0:40:17.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}简直像现实版的童话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like a real life fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.65,0:40:20.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}创造了历史。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}History made.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.18,0:40:24.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，昆恩，我……我真的很抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, Quinn, I'm... I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.19,0:40:28.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我试过了，可是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I tried, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.70,0:40:32.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以结束了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So it's over?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.74,0:40:43.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯……只是迟早的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well... it was only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.51,0:40:46.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少我们轰轰烈烈地退场了，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At least we went out with a bang, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.68,0:40:55.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家，呃，杰瑞米有事要告诉你们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Guys, uh, Jeremy has something to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.62,0:40:59.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……你们再也不用担心他们了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um... you don't ever have to worry about them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.03,0:41:02.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说过我愿意做任何事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told you I'd do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.73,0:41:13.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 噢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Oooh
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.84,0:41:16.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}11点有突发新闻直播。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have live breaking news at 11:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.07,0:41:18.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}急救人员已赶到单车事故现场，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Emergency crews are on the scene of a single-car accident
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.68,0:41:20.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}位于贝伍德峡谷路。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}at Baywood Canyon Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.78,0:41:23.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}目前还没有车内人员状况的报告。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There are no reports yet on the condition of the occupants.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.11,0:41:25.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们将持续为您更新更多细节，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We will be updating you with more details
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.12,0:41:27.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一旦有消息就报道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as they become available.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.06,0:41:33.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 噢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Ooh
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.79,0:41:38.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 噢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Ooh
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.23,0:41:44.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 救救我，我的爱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Save me, my love
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.84,0:41:51.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 说你会来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Say you'll come
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.31,0:41:55.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 来解救我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* And rescue me
